<title>UK: Merrill Lynch warrants on Roche Holdings.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch warrants on Roche Holdings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets says it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on dividend right certificates of Roche Holding AG.</p>
<p>200 warrants control one dividend right certificate.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    10,000.00 SFR	   PREMIUM	10.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.30 SFR		  GEARING	11.40 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 25.NOV.96-16.JAN.98   PAYDATE	20.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 200</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  9,800.00 SFR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
